graph TD
    App["Android Application"] -->|应用 auto-service| Plugin["AutoServiceRegisterPlugin"]
    Plugin -->|创建 DSL| Extension["AutoServiceExtension"]
    Plugin -->|监听全部 Application 变体| Variant["Android Components Variant"]
    Variant -->|ScopedArtifacts Scope.ALL| Scope["项目 + 模块 + AAR/JAR classes"]
    Plugin -->|每个变体注册| Task["AutoServiceRegisterTask"]
    Extension -->|require / exclude / logLevel| Task
    Scope -->|输入 JAR 与目录| Task
    Task -->|读取 class 元数据| Scanner["ClassMetadataScanner"]
    Scanner -->|来源、候选、稳定排序| Catalog["ServiceCatalog"]
    Catalog -->|构建期 require 校验| Validator["RequiredServiceValidator"]
    Catalog -->|生成加载表和变体诊断表| Generators["Registry Generators"]
    Generators -->|ServiceRegistry.java 等| Compiler["JDK JavaCompiler"]
    Compiler -->|生成 class| Writer["DeterministicJarWriter"]
    Scope -->|移除保留存根后合并| Writer
    Writer -->|稳定的变换 classes.jar| Dex["D8 / R8 → APK"]
